  "content": "<div>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n</div><div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong><span>警告：部分生物不會自然消失，因此你必須使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/let-me-despawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">消失調整</a>來設定它們！</span></strong></span></h1>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span>寄生怪物現在會生成在失落城市中。如果你殺死一隻寄生生物，有低機率獲得一枚戒指。</span></h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span>模組推薦版本</span></h3>\n<div>\n<h1><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epca/files/8014299\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">終焉寄生與全面轉化</a> [&nbsp; 0.3.4+ ]</h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-lost-cities/files/all?page=2&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.20.1&amp;showAlphaFiles=hide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">失落城市</a> [ 7.2.0 ]</span></h1>\n<h1><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lost-cities-addon-biome-fixer/files/5990956\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">失落城市擴充：生態域修復器</a> [ 1.0.2+ ]</h1>\n<h1><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets-and-baubles-reforked/files/6939129\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">飾品與小飾物重製版</a> [ 1.3.1+ ]</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
